CLOCK     LDA   MOY      GET MONTH          CMPA  #$13     IS IT BOGUS (IE. 83 ERROR HAS BEEN LOGGED)          BEQ   CLOCKER  YES...SET UP FOR CLOCK ERROR          BRA   CLOCKY   EVERYTHING IS OK...GO ON*CLOCKER   LDA   #$01     TEMP. FORCE MONTH TO BE JAN.          STA   MOY          CLR   CLKDED          BSR   CLOCKY   RUN THRU JULIAN          LDA   #$13          STA   MOY      RESET TO BAD MONTH          STA   CLKDED   RESET TO DEAD CLOCK          RTS*CLOCKY    LDU   #M10DAY  SET U-POINTER TO RTC BUFFER          LDX   #MOY     SET X-POINTER TO MASTER CLOCK          LDA   4,U      GET 60-CYCLE TIMER          SUBA  #$06     HAS TIMER ACCUMULATED 6 OR MORE COUNTS          BCC   UPDATE   YES...SERVE JULIAN CLOCKS          RTS            NO...JULIAN CLOCK SHOULD NOT BE SERVEDUPDATE    STA   4,U      YES, STORE NEW 60-CYCLE TIME          BSR   JULIAN   SERVE JULIAN EVERY 100 MS          BRA   CLOCK*JULIAN    LDA   SPCNT    TEST FOR 3 SECONDS COUNT FOR $33 DM          CMPA  #100     COUNTS FROM 100 TO 130 TO TIME OFF 3 SEC          BLO   JULES    IF SPCNT<100, DISREGARD COUNTING          CMPA  #130          BHI   JULIO    IF DONE, INSURE SPCNT IS CLEARED          INC   SPCNT          BRA   JULESJULIO     CLR   SPCNTJULES     INC   2,U      INC 10/100MS TIMER (MS10HUND)          INC   3,U      INC 5/100MS TIMER (MSHUND)          LDA   #05      SET UP TO CHECK 0-5 CTR (MSHUND)          CMPA  3,U      HAS 500 MS EXPIRED?          LBNE  RELOK    NO GET OUT          CLR   3,U      CLEAR 5/100MS TIMER (MSHUND)          ASLA          CMPA  2,U      HAS MS10HUND COUNTED FOR 1000 MS?          LBNE  RELOK    NO, WAIT FOR 1000 MSEC          CLR   2,U      YES, CLEAR 10/100MS (1 SEC) TIMER          JSR   >ADDBCD  INCREMENT SECONDS TIMER (SOM)          LDB   RVFLG    ARE WE IN RAMVAL?          LBNE  RELOK    YES - SKIP REST OF CLOCK ROUTINE          CMPA  #$60     HAS 60 SECS EXPIRED?          LBLO  RELOK    NO          CLR   5,X      YES - RESTART SECONDS TIMER (SOM)          INC   KBDTMR   INC KEYBOARD TIMEOUT TIMER          LEAY  4,X          JSR   >ADDBCD  INCREMENT MINUTES TIMER (MOH)*TSTQ      CMPA  #$33     ONCE PER HOUR          BNE   TSTQX    TEST THE INSERT/EEPBURN SYSTEM          LDB   NJOBS    BUT ONLY IF THE SYSTEM IS IDLE          BNE   TSTQX          LDY   BEGPTR   IS BURN POINTER IN VALID RANGE?          CMPY  #QBUF          BLO   TSTQR          CMPY  #ENDBUF          BHS   TSTQR          LDB   ,Y       IS QUEUE ZEROED OUT?          BNE   TSTQR          LDY   ENDPTR   IS INSERT POINTER IN VALID RANGE?          CMPY  #QBUF          BLO   TSTQR          CMPY  #ENDBUF          BHS   TSTQR          CMPY  BEGPTR          BEQ   TSTQX    ALL TESTS VALID - GO ON WITH CLOCKTSTQR     LDB   #$FC     SYSTEM DOWN - REINITIALIZE - - -           STB   DMKEY    SET UP DIAG MSG          LDY   #QBUF    SET DEFAULT FOR INSERT ADDRESS          STY   DMREGX          LDY   #TSTQ    DETECTION ADDRESS          STY   DMADDR          LDB   MEMSLCT+1  DETECTION ADDRESS PORT VALUE          STB   DMMPRT  IFEQ    VERSW          LDB   XWRDREC  EXECUTE THE DIAG MSG          STB   XLAT          JSR   >XLATR  ELSE          JSR  >WRDREC   EXECUTE THE DIAG MSG  ENDC          LDY   #QBUF    RESET THE POINTERS          STY   BEGPTR          STY   ENDPTR          CLRB           INSURE ENTIRE QBUF IS CLEAREDTSTQ1     STB   ,Y+          CMPY  #ENDBUF          BNE   TSTQ1*TSTQX     TFR   A,B      CONTINUE 1 MINUTE BREAK          ANDB  #$0F     ISOLATE MINUTE UNITS          STB   1,U      SAVE 10-MIN TIMER (0-9)          LBNE  RELOK     #NOT ON A 10-MIN BREAK          INC   ,U       INC 10-MINUTE/DAY COUNTER (HEX)          CLR   ACLNER   CLEAR AC LINE ERROR COUNTER ONCE EVERY 10 MINHRBK      CMPA  #$60     ARE WE AT HOUR BREAK (60 MIN)?          LBLO  RELOK    NO,          CLR   4,X      YES - CLEAR THE MINUTES TIMER (MOH)          LDA   #1          STA   VECTOR   ENABLE PROM CHKSUM TEST IN MAIN          ADDA  3,X     INC HR TIMER (HOD)          DAA            RETAIN DECIMAL FORMAT          STA   3,X      AND SAVE IT...**    TEST FOR ANY CHANGE IN DIAG MESSAGE BUFFER...*          LDA  DMVEC     WRDREC ACTIVE DURING THE LAST HOUR?          ORA  #$20      IF YES, FORCE A BURN INSERTION OF DMSG          STA  DMVEC********************************************************************    IS A CHANGE IN HOD NEEDED FOR DAYLIGHT SAVINGS TIME?*HRBK1     BSR  DSTTST    CORRECT MASTER CLOCK IF NEEDED          JMP  >CLRH**    SUBROUTINE: TEST FOR A CHANGE NEEDED FOR DAYLITE TIME *         (ALSO CALLED IN EXECUTIVE)DSTTST    PSHS A,B,X       SAVE INCOMING REGISTERS          LDA  CLKDED    IS MASTER CLOCK ACTIVE?          CMPA #$13          BEQ  DSTRTS      IF NOT, SKIP DST SOFTWARE          LDB  DST          BNE  CKDST     IF CLEARED, THEN DST NEVER SET UPDSTNEW    JSR  >LDDST    LOAD DEFAULT VALUES           BRA  DSTDON    AND GO SET UP TO BURN ITCKDST     BITB #$40          BEQ  CKDSTE    GO - NO CHANGE NEEDED          LDX  #MOY      RESTORE POINTER TO MASTER CLOCK          LDB  6,X       CHECK IF PAST SUNDAY (HAD POWERDOWN)          CMPB #1        IF SO,  MAKE CHANGE REGARDLESS OF TIME          BHI  DODST          LDA  3,X       RELOAD HOUR OF DAY          CMPA #2        IT'S SUNDAY - IS IT 2:00 AM YET?          BLO  CKDSTE    NO - NOT TIME YET TO CHANGE OVERDODST     LDB  DST       OKAY - IS IT SPRING OR FALL CHANGE?          CMPB #$41      IS THIS THE SPRING CHANGE?          BNE  DECHR     NO - GO DO FALL CHANGE          LDY  #HOD           YES - SET THE HOUR HAND AHEAD          JSR  >ADDBCD   (INCREMENT HOD & STORE IT)          LDB  #$10      RESET DST FLAG TO SHOW EDT IN EFFECT          STB  DST          BRA  DSTDON    AND GO SET UP TO BURN IT IN EEPROMDECHR     CMPB #$50      IS THIS THE FALL CHANGE?          BEQ  DECHRGO   YES - PROCEED           JSR  >DETDST   NO - BOGUS VALUE IN DST - RECOMPUTE IT          BRA  CKDSTEDECHRGO   LDB  #1         ITS FALL - SET THE HOUR HAND BACK          STB  DST        RESET DST FLAG TO SHOW EST IN EFFECT          JSR  >MINBCD          STA  3,X       AND SAVE THE NEW HOURS COUNT DSTDON    LDB  #1          LDX  #DST      INSERT THE NEW DST FLAG FOR EEPROM BURN          STX  SADDR          STB  LEN       SAVE DATA TO BE SENT TO SUBROUTINE INSERT          LDB  EPROMF          STB  EPROMFM          JSR  >INSERT          LDB  EPROMFM          STB  EPROMF          LDB  #$FF      RESET DAY CLOCK TABLE OFFSET          STB  RTCGENDSTRTS    PULS A,B,X      RESTORE INCOMING REGISTERS          RTSCKDSTE    LDA  EEPGOOD   ABLE TO READ EEPROM?          LDB  EEPGOOD+1          CMPA #$B5          BNE  DSTDON    NO  - CAN'T READ EEPROM          CMPB #$4A          BNE  DSTDON          LDB  DSTE                CMPB DST       IS THE DST VALUE IN EEPROM STILL CURRENT?          BNE  DSTDON    NO- GO SET UP TO REPAIR IT?          PULS A,B,X       RESTORE INCOMING REGISTERS          RTS*  IFEQ    VERSW-0*SETODCOR  LDA  #$01          STA  TODCOR    SET COORD. CLOCK SWITCH          JMP  >RELOK    GO ON*  ENDC*CLRH      LDA   3,X  IFEQ    VERSW-0          CMPA  #$02     IS IT 2:00 AM          BEQ   SETODCOR YES...SET UP COORD SYNC CLOCKS  ENDC          CMPA  #$24     NO...ARE WE AT 2400 HRS?          CLRB           YES...          STB   CPDTO    RESET CPD TRIP COUNTER ONCE A DAY          STB   PWRCN    RESET POWERDOWN COUNTER EACH DAY          STB   LRSED    CLEAR SPECIAL LOWER RAM FLAG EACH DAY          STB   3,X      CLEAR HOURS TIMER (HOD)          STB   ,U       CLR 10-MIN/DAY COUNTER          INC   6,X      INC DAY OF WEEK (1-7)          LEAY  1,X          JSR   >ADDBCD  INCREMENT DAY OF MONTH TIMER (DOM)          LDA   5,U      INCREMENT DAY OF YEAR (DOY - 2 BYTES)          LDB   6,U          ADDB  #1          STB   6,U          ADCA  #0          STA   5,U          LDA   CLKDED   IS MASTER CLOCK ACTIVE?          CMPA  #$13          LBEQ   RELOK          LDA   #$FF     HOLD OFF KS TILL THRU WITH GTC REGEN          STA   EDTDEL          STA   YEARGEN          STA   RTCGEN   SET UP TO REDO ALL GTC TABLES          STA   DAYGEN          LDA   ,X       GET MONTH OF YEAR (MOY)          CMPA  #$0A     CONVERT IT TO HEX FOR THE OFFSET          BLO   GETMON          SUBA  #$06     FIND # OF DAYS IN THIS MONTHGETMON    LDY   #MONTBL          DECA          LDB   A,Y          STB   SPA      TEMP STORE ITGOLEAP    LDA   1,X      GET DAY OF MONTH          CMPA  SPA      ARE WE OVER DAYS IN MONTH          BLS   WEEK     NO, GO CHECK DAY OF WEEK          JSR   >LEAPYR  ARE WE IN A LEAP YEAR          BCC   NOLEAP   NO - JUST TRANSFER TO NEXT MONTH          LDB   ,X          CMPB  #$02          BNE   NOLEAP          CMPA  #$29     IS IT LEAP DAY?          BEQ   WEEK     YES - CHECK DAY OF WEEKNOLEAP    LEAY  ,X          JSR   >ADDBCD  YES - INCREMENT MONTH OF YEAR (MOY)          CMPA  #$13     YEAR OVER?          BNE   DSET     NO, SKIP NEW YEAR SETUP          LDA   #1       YES          STA   ,X       SET MONTH=1          STA   6,U      SET DAY OF YEAR (LO-BYTE)=1          CLR   5,U      CLR DAY OF YEAR (HI-BYTE)          CLR   7,X      CLR WEEK OF YEAR          ADDA  2,X      INC YEAR          DAA            RETAIN DECIMAL FORMAT          STA   2,X      SAVE NEW YEAR          LDB   #8          CMPB  6,X      IS FIRST DAY OF YEAR A SUNDAY          BEQ   DSET     YES, ALLOW WEEK ROUTINE (BELOW) TO CORRECT WOYDSET      LDA   #1          STA   1,X      SET DOM=1*WEEK      LDA   6,X      WEEK OVER?          CMPA  #8          LBLO   INITYC   NO, CHECK FOR REGEN. YEAR PROG. TABLE          LDA   #1       YES, ITS SUNDAY          STA   6,X      SET DOW = 1          INC   7,X      INC WEEK OF YEAR  IFEQ    VERSW-0          CLR   COUNT3   COURT OF LAST RESORT ERRORS          LDX   #ARESET  POINT TO ALARM AREA          CLRALOOPBAK   LDB   ,X+      INC. LOCATION          CMPB  #7       DO WE HAVE > = 7 RESETS???          BHS   LOOPBAK  YES...DONT CLEAR OUT RESETS          STA   ,X       NO..CLEAR OUT RESETS          CMPX  #ENDDA   ARE WE THRU???          BLO   LOOPBAK  NO...          CLR   CNT78    CLEAR TBC COUNTER          LDA   SERRSW   GET TIMEBASE SYNC SWITCH          CMPA  #$09     HAVE WE HAD TOO MANY PHANTOM SYNCS          BHS   CLREST   YES...DON'T CLEAR TIMEBASE SYNC ERROR COUNTER          CLR   SERRSW   NO..CLEAR IT NOWCLREST    CLRA  ELSE*          LDX   #ARESET  POINT TO ALARM AREA*          CLRA*LOOPBAK   LDB   ,X+      INC. LOCATION*          CMPB  #7       DO WE HAVE > = 7 RESETS???*          BHS   LOOPBAK  YES...DONT CLEAR OUT RESETS*          STA   ,X       NO..CLEAR OUT RESETS*          CMPX  #ENDDA   ARE WE THRU???*          BLO   LOOPBAK  NO...          CLRA  ENDC          CLRB          STA   COUNTRP            STA   SWICNT          STB   SWICNT+1          STA   SHRTCNT          STB   SHRTCNT+1          STA   RSWI     CLEAR ALL POWER DOWN COUNTERS ONCE A WEEK          STB   RSWI+1          STA   RSHRT          STB   RSHRT+1          LDX   #MOY     YES...RESTORE X-POINTER          JMP   >DAYLIT**         SUBROUTINE:  SUBTRACT IN BCD FORMAT*              A - B  ->  A                ( A >= B)*MINBCD    STA  RTEMP1    TEMP STORE MINUEND          STB  RTEMP2    TEMP STORE SUBTRAHEND          LDA  #$99      TO COMPUTE:          SUBA RTEMP2         $99 - B          ORCC #$01          ADCA RTEMP1          DAA          RTS**         SUBROUTINE - INCREMENT THE BCD VALUE POINTED BY REG Y*ADDBCD    LDA  ,Y        READ THE VALUE          ADDA #1        HEX INCREMENT IT          DAA            CONVERT SUM TO BCD          STA  ,Y        AND SAVE IT          RTS********************************************************************    SUBROUTINE - DETERMINE THE CURRENT DST STATUS OF THE MASTER CLOCK*DETDST    PSHS A,B,X          LDX  #DSTVAR   POINT TO DST VARIABLES          LDA  ,X        IS DAYLIGHT SAVINGS TIME INTENDED?          CMPA 1,X       IF START AND END VARIABLES ARE THE SAME          BNE  DTDST          - THEN FORGET IT. ALWAYS STANDARD TIME.          BRA  SETESTDTDST     LDA  MOY       OKAY. LOOK FOR CHANGES...          JSR  >DECBIN          CMPA ,X        ARE WE BEFORE STARTING MONTH?          BLO  SETEST    YES - MUST BE STANDARD TIME          BHI  DTDST3    NO - GO CHECK ENDING MONTH          LDA  2,X       IN STARTING MONTH - CHECK WEEK NO.          CMPA #5        LOOKING FOR LAST WEEK IN MONTH?          BLO  DTDST1    NO - GO CHECK INDICATED WEEK          JSR  >DAYLTS   IN LAST WEEK?          BHI  SETEST    NO - MUST BE IN STANDARD TIME          JSR  >DECBIN   CHANGE REG. A TO HEX          TFR  A,B          BRA  DTDST2    YES - NOW ARE WE TO THE CHANGE YET?DTDST1    LDA  DOM       CONVERT DOM TO HEX          JSR  >DECBIN          STA  SPB          LDA  2,X            LDB  #7        CALCULATE END OF INDICATED WEEK          MUL          CMPB SPB       IS THE CLOCK PAST THIS WEEK YET?          BLO  DTDST3    YES - GO CHECK ENDING MONTH          SUBB #6        NO - FIND BEGINNING OF WEEK          CMPB SPB       ARE WE TO START OF THIS WEEK YET?          BHI  SETEST    NO - MUST BE IN STANDARD TIMEDTDST2    NEGB           OKAY - WE HAVE AN ELIGIBLE WEEK          ADDB SPB       CALCULATE OFFSET BETWEEN CLOCK AND          INCB                - START OF THE WEEK          CMPB DOW       ARE WE TO SUNDAY YET?          BLO  SETEST    NO - MUST BE IN STANDARD TIME          LDB  DOW       IS THIS CURRENTLY SUNDAY?          CMPB #1          BHI  SETEDT    NO - MUST BE IN DAYLIGHT TIME          LDB  HOD       YES - SO IS IT PAST 2:00 AM?          CMPB #2          BLO  SETESTC    NO - MUST BE IN E.S.T. READY TO CHANGESETEDT    LDA  #$10      YES - SET DST FLAG - IN DAYLIGHT TIME          BRA  SETDSTSETEDTC   LDA  #$50          BRA  SETDSTSETESTC   LDA  #$41          BRA  SETDSTSETEST    LDA  #1        SET DST FLAG - IN STANDARD TIMESETDST    STA  DST          PULS A,B,X          RTS  DTDST3    LDA  MOY       POSSIBLE TO BE IN DAYLIGHT TIME          JSR  >DECBIN          CMPA 1,X       ARE WE IN ENDING MONTH?          BLO  SETEDT    NO - MUST BE IN DAYLIGHT TIME          BHI  SETEST    NO - MUST BE IN STANDARD TIME          LDA  3,X       YES - IN THE RIGHT WEEK?          CMPA #5        LOOKING FOR THE LAST WEEK OF THE MONTH?          JSR  >DAYLTS   YES - ARE WE IN LAST WEEK?          BHI  SETEDT    NO - MUST BE IN DAYLIGHT TIME          JSR  >DECBIN          TFR  A,B          BRA  DTDST5    YES - NOW ARE WE TO THE CHANGE YET?DTDST4    LDA  DOM       CONVERT DOM TO HEX          JSR  >DECBIN          STA  SPB          LDA  3,X          LDB  #7        CALCULATE END OF INDICATED WEEK          MUL          CMPB SPB       ARE WE PAST THIS WEEK?          BLO  SETEST    YES - MUST BE IN STANDARD TIME          SUBB #6        ARE WE BEFORE START OF THIS WEEK?          CMPB SPB          BHI  SETEDT    YES - MUST BE IN DAYLIGHT TIMEDTDST5    NEGB           OKAY - IN AN ELIGIBLE WEEK          ADDB SPB       CALCULATE OFFSET BETWEEN CLOCK AND          INCB                - START OF THE WEEK          CMPB DOW       ARE WE TO SUNDAY YET?          BLO  SETEDT    NO - MUST BE IN DAYLIGHT TIME          LDB  DOW       SO IS IT SUNDAY?          CMPB #1          BHI  SETEST    NO - PAST IT - MUST BE STANDARD TIME          LDB  HOD       YES - ARE PAST 2:00 AM?          CMPB #2          BLO  SETEDTC    NO - STILL E.D.T. READY TO CHANGE          BRA  SETEST    YES - MUST BE STANDARD TIME***    BEGIN REGULAR WEEKLY INSPECTION OF DST VARIABLES*DAYLIT    LDX  #DSTVAR   FIRST CHECK VALIDITY OF DST WORDS          LDA  ,X        START MONTH MUST BE 1 - 12          LBEQ  DAYLIT5   N.G. - GO LOAD DEFAULT VALUES          CMPA #12          LBHI  DAYLIT5          LDA  1,X       ENDING MONTH MUST BE 1 - 12          LBEQ  DAYLIT5          CMPA #12          LBHI  DAYLIT5          LDA  2,X       WEEK NO. MUST BE 1 - 5          LBEQ  DAYLIT5          CMPA #5          LBHI  DAYLIT5          LDA  3,X       WEEK NO. MUST BE 1 - 5          LBEQ  DAYLIT5          CMPA #5          LBHI  DAYLIT5*                        ALL DST WORDS ARE VALID          LDA  DSTCHK    IS DST CHECKSUM IN RAM VALID?          BSR  DSTSM          LBEQ  DAYLT     OKAY - GO CHECK FOR OCCURRENCE OF DST          LDA  EEPGOOD    DST INVALID - ABLE TO READ EEPROM?          LDB  EEPGOOD+1          CMPA #$B5          LBNE INITYC    CAN'T READ EEPROM SO SKIP DST VAR. INSPECTION          CMPB #$4A          LBNE INITYC          LDA  DSTCHKE   NO - CHECK VALIDITY OF DST CHKSM IN EEPROM          BSR  DSTSM          BNE  DAYLIT1   NO - CHECK VALIDITY OF DST WORDS IN EEPROM          LDA  DSTCHKE   YES - CORRECT DST CHKSM IN RAM          STA  DSTCHK          JMP  >DAYLT     AND GO CHECK FOR OCCURRENCE OF DSTDAYLIT1   LDX  #DSTVARE  ARE DST WORDS IN EEPROM VALID?          LDA  DSTCHK          BSR  DSTSM          BNE  DAYLIT4   NO - RECHECK VALIDITY OF DST CHKSM IN EEPROMDAYLIT2   BSR  DSTCPY    YES - TRANSFER EEPROM DATA TO RAM          JMP  >DAYLT     AND GO CHECK FOR OCCURRENCE OF DST CHANGE*DSTSM     EORA ,X        SUBROUTINE TO SUM DST WORDS          EORA 1,X       (NOTE: ANY VALUE XOR'ED WITH ITSELF = 0)          EORA 2,X          EORA 3,X          RTS*DSTCPY    LDX  #DSTVAR   SUBROUTINE - COPY ALL DST DATA IN EEPROM TO RAM          LDB  #4        SET LOOP COUNT TO COPY 4 BYTESDSTCPY1   LDA  $2000,X          STA  ,X+          DECB          BNE  DSTCPY1          LDX  #DSTVAR          BSR  LDDSTC    REDO DST CHKSM IN RAM          RTS*          DAYLIT4   LDB  #3        SET UP REDUNDACY ON READING EEPROMDAYLITR   LDA  DSTCHKE   RECHECK VALIDITY OF DST CHKSM IN EEPROM          STA  SPA          BSR  DSTSM          BEQ  DAYLITK          DECB          BNE  DAYLITR   IF READS OF EEPROM NO GOOD, TRY AGAIN          BRA  DAYLIT5   GIVE UP - GO SET UP DEFAULT VALUESDAYLITK   LDA  SPA       READ GOOD          STA  DSTCHK          BRA  DAYLIT2   NOW GO CORRECT DST WORDS IN RAM*LDDST     LDX  #DSTVAR   SUBROUTINE - LOAD DEFAULT VALUES TO DST WORDS          LDB  #4        START 1ST WEEK IN APRIL          STB  ,X          LDB  #1          STB  2,X          LDB  #10       END LAST WEEK IN OCTOBER          STB  1,X          LDB  #5          STB  3,XLDDSTC    LDB  ,X        CALCULATE THE DST CHECKSUM          EORB 1,X          EORB 2,X          EORB 3,X          STB  DSTCHK          LDB  #4        NOW INSERT NEW DST WORDS TO BURN QUEUE          STX  SADDR          STB  LEN       SAVE DATA TO BE SENT TO SUBROUTINE INSERT          JSR  >INSERT          RTS*DAYLTS    LDY  #MONTBL   POINT TO DAYS IN MONTH TABLE          LDA  MOY       CALCULATE START OF LAST WEEK IN MONTH          JSR  >DECBIN          LDA  A,Y          JSR  >LEAPYR   CHECK FOR LEAP YEAR CORRECTION - IS IT LEAP YEAR          BCC  DAYLTS1   NO...          LDB  MOY          CMPB #2          BNE  DAYLTS1          INCADAYLTS1   LDB  #6          JSR  >MINBCD          CMPA DOM       ARE WE WITHIN LAST WEEK OF THE MONTH?          RTS*DECBIN    PSHS A         SUBROUTINE - CONVERT BCD VALUE IN REG. A          ANDA #$F0           TO HEX   - REG. B USED          LSRA          LSRA          LSRA          LSRA          LDB  #10          MUL          STB  DISMS          PULS A          ANDA #$0F          ADDA DISMS          RTS*DAYLIT5   BSR  LDDST     LOAD THE DEFAULT VALUES FOR DST WORDSDAYLT     LDX  #DSTVAR   DO WE NEED TO CORRECT FOR DST?          LDA  MOY       GET CURRENT MONTH          JSR  >DECBIN          CMPA ,X        IS IT DST STARTING MONTH?          BLO  INITYC    NO - LEAVE DST SECTION          BHI  DAYLT3    NO - CHECK FOR ENDING MONTH          LDA  2,X       OKAY - GET THE WEEK NUMBER          CMPA #5        IS IT LAST WEEK OF MONTH?          BLO  DAYLT1    NO - GO CHECK WHICH WEEK          BSR  DAYLTS    ARE WE IN LAST WEEK?          BHI  INITYC    NO - LEAVE DST SECTION          BRA  DAYLT2    YES - GO IMPLEMENT SPRING CHANGEDAYLT1    LDA  DOM       CONVERT DOM TO HEX          JSR  >DECBIN          STA  SPB          LDA  2,X          LDB  #7        CALCULATE END OF SCHEDULED WEEK          MUL          CMPB SPB       BEFORE THE END OF THE WEEK?          BLO  INITYC     NO - GO LEAVE DST SECTION          SUBB #6        CALULATE BEGIN OF SCHEDULED WEEK          CMPB SPB       BEFORE START OF THE WEEK?          BHI  INITYC    NO - LEAVE DST SECTIONDAYLT2    LDA  #$41      OKAY!  SET FLAG TO IMPLEMENT SPRING CHANGE          STA  DST          BRA  INITYC    AND LEAVE DST SECTIONDAYLT3    CMPA 1,X       ARE WE IN ENDING MONTH?          BNE  INITYC     NO - LEAVE DST SECTION          LDA  3,X       YES - GET SCHEDULED WEEK NUMBER          CMPA #5        IS IT LAST WEEK OF MONTH?          BLO  DAYLT4    NO - CHECK THE SCHEDULED WEEK          JSR  >DAYLTS    YES - ARE WE IN THE LAST WEEK?          BHI  INITYC    NO - LEAVE DST SECTION          BRA  DAYLT5    YES - GO IMPLEMENT THE FALL CHANGEDAYLT4    LDA  DOM       CONVERT DOM TO HEX          JSR  >DECBIN          STA  SPB          LDA  3,X          LDB  #7        CALCULATE THE END OF THE SCHEDULED WEEK          MUL          CMPB SPB       BEFORE END OF THE WEEK?          BLO  INITYC     NO - LEAVE DST SECTION          SUBB #6        CALCULATE START OF THE WEEK          CMPB SPB       BEFORE START OF WEEK?          BHI  INITYC    YES - GO LEAVE DST SECTIONDAYLT5    LDA  #$50      OKAY! SET FLAG TO IMPLEMENT FALL CHANGE          STA  DST*************************************************************INITYC    CLRA          LDB   #1          TSTA          BNE   RELOK          CMPB  DOY+1       ARE WE STARTING A NEW YEAR?          BNE   RELOK     NO, EXIT.          LDB   DOW       YES, SET UP FOR A NEW YEAR PROGRAM          DECB          STB   YPOFST    NEW JAN.1 OFFSET FOR YEAR PROGRAM TABLERELOK     LDA   MS10HUN   GET NOW CURRENT VALUE OF 0.1 SECOND          STA   TOS            TO UPDATE RTC TOS          LDA  DIEFLG          LDB  DIEFLG+1          CMPA #$A5       ARE WE IN A DEAD STATE          BNE  RELOKRT    YES...BYPASS BURN OF POWER DOWN COUNTERS          CMPB #$5A          BNE  RELOKRT          LDA  EEPGOOD    ABLE TO READ EEPROM?          LDB  EEPGOOD+1          CMPA #$B5          BNE  RELOKRT    NO - SKIP NEXT FOR THIS TIME          CMPB #$4A                 BNE  RELOKRT          LDB  #4         DID POWERDOWN COUNTERS CHANGE?          LDX  #PWRCN     POINT TO 4 VARIABLESRELOKA    LDA  $2000,X    READ EEPROM VALUE          CMPA ,X+        COMPARE TO VALUUE IN RAM          BNE  RELOKB     IF CHANGED, GO BURN NEW VALUE          DECB          BNE  RELOKA          BRA  RELOKRT    NO CHANGES - EXIT  IFNE    VERSW-0RELOKB    LDA  CCPYMR+T   DO NOT BURN IF RAMCOPY IN PROGRESS          BNE  RELOKRT          LDA  RTCASW    DON'T BURN IF IN EXEC OR GUARD  ELSERELOKB    LDB  RTCASW     DON'T BURN IF IN EXEC OR GUARD  ENDC          BNE  RELOKRT          LDB  #4         CHANGE OCCURRED          LDX  #PWRCN     SET UP INSERTION FOR BURN          LDA  EPROMF     DO NOT REBURN EEP CHKSUUMS!!!          STA  EPROMFM    SAVE IN  MIRROR WORD          STX  SADDR          STB  LEN       SAVE DATA TO BE SENT TO SUBROUTINE INSERT          JSR  >INSERT          LDA  EPROMFM    RESTORE EPROMF          STA  EPROMFRELOKRT   RTS**         MONTBL    FCB   $31     JANUARY          FCB   $28     FEBRUARY          FCB   $31     MARCH          FCB   $30     APRIL          FCB   $31     MAY          FCB   $30     JUNE          FCB   $31     JULY          FCB   $31     AUGUST          FCB   $30     SEPTEMBER          FCB   $31     OCTOBER          FCB   $30     NOVEMBER          FCB   $31     DECEMBER*****    SUBROUTINE:  KILL MASTER TIME CLOCKSKILLCLK   LDA  #$13      BOTH CLOCKS BAD!  TOTAL DISABLE OF CLOCKS          STA  ,X          STA  CLKDED          STA  CLKDED1          ORCC #$50      DISABLE INTERRUPTS DURING WRDREC          LDA  #$20      SET DIAG MESSAGE FOR MASTER CLOCK FAILURE          STA  DMKEY          LDX  ,S        DETECTION ADDRESS          STX  DMADDR          LDA  MEMSLCT+1   DETECTION ADDRESS PORT VALUES          STA  DMMPRT          LDA  #8        TYPE OF RESET  (NONE)          STA  TYPRES  IFEQ    VERSW-0          LDA  XWRDREC   EXECUTE THE DIAG MESSAGE          STA  XLAT          JSR  >XLATR  ELSE          JSR  >WRDREC   EXECUTE THE DIAG MSG  ENDC          RTS**